<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to May 2.</p>
<p>Top 10 gains in week    Price  percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		    May 2  change</p>
<p> 1   Sthn Pac Pete	  3.84    8.78</p>
<p> 2   Centaur Min&amp;Expl     1.74    7.41</p>
<p> 3   Lihir Gold	     2.42    7.08</p>
<p> 4   Westfield Hlds	24.10    6.64</p>
<p> 5   Fletcher Nz Fst	1.77    5.36</p>
<p> 6   Aust Foundation	2.20    4.76</p>
<p> 7   Howard Smith	  11.35    4.61</p>
<p> 8   Gandel Retail Tr     0.95    4.40</p>
<p> 9   Wesfarmers	    10.91    4.38</p>
<p>10   Woolworths	     3.90    4.28</p>
<p>Top 10 falls in week     Price  percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		    May 2  change</p>
<p> 1   Newcrest Mining	3.45  -13.97</p>
<p> 2   Great Central	  2.49   -9.45</p>
<p> 3   Acacia Resources     1.80   -7.22</p>
<p> 4   Comalco		  6.20   -6.63</p>
<p> 5   Village Road-Pr	3.15   -4.55</p>
<p> 6   Macquarie Bank	 9.15   -4.19</p>
<p> 7   Gen Prop Tr	    2.33   -4.12</p>
<p> 8   Orogen Minerals	2.90   -3.97</p>
<p> 9   GIO Australian	 3.74   -3.86</p>
<p>10   Coca-Cola Am	  14.65   -3.62</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
</text>
